{"id":"9a69c2c80263c834","group":"67","path":"67/67-thm-sigma1-sound-provability-rule-equivalence.md","title":"Sigma1 Soundness Implies Provability Rule Equivalence","display":"thm-sigma1-sound-provability-rule-equivalence — Sigma1 Soundness Implies Provability Rule Equivalence","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Aspects of Incompleteness Lindstrom","book_abbrev":"67","label":"67-thm-sigma1-sound-provability-rule-equivalence","aliases":["67-thm-sigma1-sound-provability-rule-equivalence"],"display":"thm-sigma1-sound-provability-rule-equivalence — Sigma1 Soundness Implies Provability Rule Equivalence","depends_on":["[[67-df-PA]]","[[67-df-provability-predicate]]","[[67-df-provability-conditions]]","[[67-df-sigma1-sound]]","[[67-df-provability-rule-equivalence]]"],"source_edition":"Cambridge/ASL 2016 reprint of 1997 edition","verification_status":"locally-revised-not-source-reverified","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"source_chapter":2,"source_label":"§4 discussion of rule R","source_printed_pages":34,"source_pdf_pages":45,"source_proof_status":"本轮核对形式陈述、类型、变量绑定和册内依赖；未重新核验原书 PDF，未作机器证明","input_verification_status":"source-statement-checked","input_source_proof_status":"陈述及下述本地推导已复核；未作机器证明","revision_status":"locally-revised","revision_date":"2026-10-14","machine_verified":false,"renamed_from":"67-thm-feferman-completeness"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Aspects of Incompleteness Lindstrom"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"67"},{"key":"label","html":"67-thm-sigma1-sound-provability-rule-equivalence"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>67-thm-sigma1-sound-provability-rule-equivalence</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-sigma1-sound-provability-rule-equivalence — Sigma1 Soundness Implies Provability Rule Equivalence"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"cd051851df5d2aa2\" href=\"?note=cd051851df5d2aa2\" title=\"67-df-PA\">67-df-PA</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"6a4c234306a0ec0c\" href=\"?note=6a4c234306a0ec0c\" title=\"67-df-provability-predicate\">67-df-provability-predicate</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"8c48c66841a15eb9\" href=\"?note=8c48c66841a15eb9\" title=\"67-df-provability-conditions\">67-df-provability-conditions</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"b0667bf165ad62df\" href=\"?note=b0667bf165ad62df\" title=\"67-df-sigma1-sound\">67-df-sigma1-sound</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"1f0d2aa0523acd52\" href=\"?note=1f0d2aa0523acd52\" title=\"67-df-provability-rule-equivalence\">67-df-provability-rule-equivalence</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Cambridge/ASL 2016 reprint of 1997 edition"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"locally-revised-not-source-reverified"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"source_chapter","html":"2"},{"key":"source_label","html":"§4 discussion of rule R"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"34"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"45"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"本轮核对形式陈述、类型、变量绑定和册内依赖；未重新核验原书 PDF，未作机器证明"},{"key":"input_verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"input_source_proof_status","html":"陈述及下述本地推导已复核；未作机器证明"},{"key":"revision_status","html":"locally-revised"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-14"},{"key":"machine_verified","html":"false"},{"key":"renamed_from","html":"67-thm-feferman-completeness"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\supseteq\\mathrm{PA}\">\\(T\\supseteq\\mathrm{PA}\\)</span> 是有效算术呈示，标准 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prov}_T(v)\\in\\Sigma_1\">\\(\\mathrm{Prov}_T(v)\\in\\Sigma_1\\)</span> 满足 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"8c48c66841a15eb9\" href=\"?note=8c48c66841a15eb9\" title=\"67-df-provability-conditions\">67-df-provability-conditions</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BL}(T,\\mathrm{Prov}_T)\">\\(\\mathrm{BL}(T,\\mathrm{Prov}_T)\\)</span>，且其标准模型语义对应同一外部证明关系，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"6a4c234306a0ec0c\" href=\"?note=6a4c234306a0ec0c\" title=\"67-df-provability-predicate\">67-df-provability-predicate</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sound}_{\\Sigma_1}\">\\(\\mathrm{Sound}_{\\Sigma_1}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ProvRuleEq}\">\\(\\mathrm{ProvRuleEq}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"b0667bf165ad62df\" href=\"?note=b0667bf165ad62df\" title=\"67-df-sigma1-sound\">67-df-sigma1-sound</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"1f0d2aa0523acd52\" href=\"?note=1f0d2aa0523acd52\" title=\"67-df-provability-rule-equivalence\">67-df-provability-rule-equivalence</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sound}_{\\Sigma_1}(T)\\Longrightarrow\\mathrm{ProvRuleEq}(T).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Sound}_{\\Sigma_1}(T)\\Longrightarrow\\mathrm{ProvRuleEq}(T).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\vdash\\varphi\">\\(T\\vdash\\varphi\\)</span>，由 BL 的第一条件得到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash\\mathrm{Prov}_T(\\overline{g(\\varphi)})\">\\(\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash\\mathrm{Prov}_T(\\overline{g(\\varphi)})\\)</span>，从而 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\vdash\\mathrm{Prov}_T(\\overline{g(\\varphi)})\">\\(T\\vdash\\mathrm{Prov}_T(\\overline{g(\\varphi)})\\)</span>。反向由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_1\">\\(\\Sigma_1\\)</span>-可靠性及标准模型中的证明对应得到实际的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span>-证明。本条只保留该充分条件并按内容更名，不将其作为 Feferman 完备性定理；既有的 sigma1-sound-provability-correctness 条目保持不变。来源页码沿用输入档案，本轮未重新核验原书。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"67-df-PA","status":"resolved","id":"cd051851df5d2aa2","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-PA]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-provability-predicate","status":"resolved","id":"6a4c234306a0ec0c","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-provability-predicate]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-provability-conditions","status":"resolved","id":"8c48c66841a15eb9","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-provability-conditions]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-sigma1-sound","status":"resolved","id":"b0667bf165ad62df","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-sigma1-sound]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-provability-rule-equivalence","status":"resolved","id":"1f0d2aa0523acd52","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-provability-rule-equivalence]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-provability-conditions","status":"resolved","id":"8c48c66841a15eb9","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$T\\supseteq\\mathrm{PA}$ 是有效算术呈示，标准 $\\mathrm{Prov}_T(v)\\in\\Sigma_1$ 满足 [[67-df-provability-conditions]] 的 $\\mathrm{BL}(T,\\mathrm{Prov}_T)$，且其标准模型语义对应同一外部证明关系，见 [[67-df-provability-predicate]]。","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-provability-predicate","status":"resolved","id":"6a4c234306a0ec0c","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$T\\supseteq\\mathrm{PA}$ 是有效算术呈示，标准 $\\mathrm{Prov}_T(v)\\in\\Sigma_1$ 满足 [[67-df-provability-conditions]] 的 $\\mathrm{BL}(T,\\mathrm{Prov}_T)$，且其标准模型语义对应同一外部证明关系，见 [[67-df-provability-predicate]]。","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-sigma1-sound","status":"resolved","id":"b0667bf165ad62df","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Sound}_{\\Sigma_1}$ 与 $\\mathrm{ProvRuleEq}$ 见 [[67-df-sigma1-sound]]、[[67-df-provability-rule-equivalence]]。","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-provability-rule-equivalence","status":"resolved","id":"1f0d2aa0523acd52","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Sound}_{\\Sigma_1}$ 与 $\\mathrm{ProvRuleEq}$ 见 [[67-df-sigma1-sound]]、[[67-df-provability-rule-equivalence]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"T\\supseteq\\mathrm{PA}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Prov}_T(v)\\in\\Sigma_1","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{BL}(T,\\mathrm{Prov}_T)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sound}_{\\Sigma_1}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ProvRuleEq}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sound}_{\\Sigma_1}(T)\\Longrightarrow\\mathrm{ProvRuleEq}(T).","display":true},{"tex":"T\\vdash\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash\\mathrm{Prov}_T(\\overline{g(\\varphi)})","display":false},{"tex":"T\\vdash\\mathrm{Prov}_T(\\overline{g(\\varphi)})","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma_1","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false}],"bytes":2249,"backlinks":[{"id":"1f0d2aa0523acd52","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"保留原公式的两向元语言可证对应，只按内容修正文件名和谓词名，不将它称为 Feferman 完备性。它不是内部全反思模式。已有的 provability-correctness 条目不改名、不删改；充分条件见 [[67-thm-sigma1-sound-provability-rule-equivalence]]。"},{"id":"aceae1bb446510ab","anchor":"ref-175","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../67-thm-sigma1-sound-provability-rule-equivalence]]"}],"outgoing":["cd051851df5d2aa2","6a4c234306a0ec0c","8c48c66841a15eb9","b0667bf165ad62df","1f0d2aa0523acd52"]}